Style is deeply personal. It’s about appreciating the craft, enjoying the details, and making it your own. Embodying this philosophy, The Glenlivet and The Bear House joined hands to launch a contemporary menswear collection—Original Attire × The Bear House. Debuting at Ajio Luxe Wkend, stylist Anaita Shroff Adajania brought her distinctive perspective to Original Attire at The Style Lab and actor Nargis Fakhri took over the DJ deck for the launch sundowner. 

